   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- MySQL 8, InnoDB, a primary + replicas?\n- Can the column start as NULL?\n- Is it derived from data we already have?\n- How long may writes pause? (aim: < 1 s)\n- Can it take hours? (yes, if it's safe)\n- Is a rollback needed? (always)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- MySQL 8, InnoDB, a primary + replicas?\n- Can the column start as NULL?\n- Is it derived from data we already have?\n- How long may writes pause? (aim: < 1 s)\n- Can it take hours? (yes, if it's safe)\n- Is a rollback needed? (always)",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
